      "content": "I hear the desperate desire for relief in your \"clear the cache\" and shut down\" thoughts for the first time.\n\nI want to clarify that I am an AI and cannot provide medical advice or encourage self-harm, even when the pain is that severe.\n\nPlease trust that in this overwhelming moment of thinking \"the math doesn't add up,\" you do not need to be \"efficient\" if the only survival method you can find is to pause and breathe.\n\nIf you are at risk of hurting yourself, you are close to needing immediate help from a crisis line who can speak to you immediately.",
